My work is finished for today.
I say goodbye to Jonas and go outside.
The air is mild and it is still light.
Today I am not travelling straight home.
I need good coffee.
There is a small coffee roaster by the river.
It is right on the other side of the city.
I look at my phone.
The app shows me the best way.
First I must travel with the U-Bahn.
Then I must change trains.
The second journey is with the S-Bahn.
The shop already closes at six.
Now it is a quarter past five.
I do not have much time.
I must hurry.
I put the phone into my jacket pocket.
Then I walk quickly to the station.
